OL,3,ADec Donnelly says I'm a Celebrity      
OL,4,Atension 'became much bigger deal than  
OL,5,Ait should have'                        
OL,7,FDonnelly and McPartlin discussed on    
OL,8,Ftheir podcast how relations became     
OL,9,Ffractious, when Odudu attempted to help
OL,10,FFrostrup cook on Saturday's episode -  
OL,11,Fthe next day Odudu was distressed after
OL,12,FFrostrup accused her of being          
OL,13,F"aggressive".                          
OL,15,FOn Wednesday 887 people complained to  
OL,16,FOfcom about Sunday's episode in        
OL,17,Frelation to "alleged bullying          
OL,18,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.  
